            "sid": "AMO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, ami nakayilemenena neyi itemba dinalemeneni nyikuta yatidiku yinenzalumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasweja lufuchi, jakutemuka jakamukaŋa, mukwaŋovu hakamona jakudikoleshaku, hela chilobu hakamona jakudipulwishaku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakwataŋa kuwuta wamukunji hakamona jakwimanaku; wukweti nyendu yasweja lufuchi hakamona jakudipulwishaku; hela wendelaŋa hakawalu hakamona jakudihandishaku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hela wasweja kuumika hadi ayilobu wakatemuka nzekesi dena ifuku odu. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.16",
